# Pompous Battlemage enters prepared (CR 722.3a), so a copy of Improvised Act waits in exile. On turn 3 Bot1 casts that copy
# (a sorcery, {R}): "You may discard a card. If you do, draw a card." - Bot1 discards the Lightning Bolt and draws the
# Black Lotus beneath. Casting the copy unprepares the Battlemage and the copy leaves exile (nothing in the graveyard:
# a copy ceases to exist, CR 707.10a). Prowess made it 2/2 until end of turn for casting a noncreature spell.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Pompous Battlemage
Mountain
Lightning Bolt
Island
Island
Island
Black Lotus
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Pompous Battlemage.Cast
[Bot1.Main2]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Pompous Battlemage.Prepared = true
? Exile = Improvised Act
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Exile.Improvised Act.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Lightning Bolt)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Pompous Battlemage.Power = 2

[Expect]
Exile.Count = 0
Bot1.Graveyard = Lightning Bolt
Bot1.Hand = Island; Island; Island; Black Lotus; Island
Bot1.Battlefield.Pompous Battlemage.Prepared = (absent)
